# 12. RAG architecture

Don't allow the LLM to freely answer medical questions.

Use:

```text
Patient Question
       ↓
Intent Detection
       ↓
Retrieve Clinic Knowledge
       ↓
Relevant Documents
       ↓
LLM
       ↓
Grounded Answer
       ↓
Safety / Confidence Check
       ↓
Patient
```

For example:

```text
"What injection do I take tonight?"
```

should retrieve:

```text
patient_protocol
medication_schedule
clinic_instructions
```

before generating an answer.

If information isn't present:

> "I don't have enough information from your clinic's materials to answer that."

